    "sentence_translations": [
      "He Doesn’t Love Me",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, what happened? Why are you crying?",
      "",
      "Lili: My boyfriend and I have broken up.",
      "",
      "Ben: Oh! Why? Is it because I told you about him having dinner with another girl?",
      "",
      "Lili: No, it’s not because of that.",
      "",
      "Ben: So why did you break up, then?",
      "",
      "Lili: Because I’m tired.",
      "",
      "Ben: Tired?",
      "",
      "Lili: Yes, I’m too tired. Every time I say let’s go eat together, he says he has to work overtime.",
      "If I say let’s go watch a movie together, he also says he has to work overtime …",
      "Now we talk for less than an hour every week. I think he doesn’t love me anymore.",
      "",
      "Ben: Don’t be sad, Lili! You’re so nice. You will definitely find someone that loves you even more in the future!",
      "",
      "Lili: Thanks, Ben! It’s so good that you’re here!",
